Third-party software

SeedGenGlobe contains no code from the mods it works with. At runtime it calls into:
  - Big Globe by Builderb0y (All Rights Reserved; see its own license). Big Globe is
    not included and must be installed separately from its official download pages.
  - Distant Horizons (LGPL-3.0), through its public API and a few optional mixins.
  - Vertigo by Builderb0y (MIT), through its public API, when installed.
The files in src/vertigoStubs only restate Vertigo's public method signatures so
SeedGenGlobe can be compiled without Vertigo; they are not part of the built jar.
